Please make sure to see/understand the licenses of the upstream data.

For example:
 - For most texts see: https://developers.sefaria.org/docs/usage-of-our-name-and-logo
 - For shiurim, just bc TorahApp has gotten permisison, doesn't mean others can use it.
 - For dicta, see: https://github.com/Dicta-Israel-Center-for-Text-Analysis/Dicta-Library-Download
